powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          风味：树莓、蔓越莓、樱桃、橙子\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          Raspberry, Cranberry, Cherry, Orange\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 8px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          大肚脐这个品种的根源从何而来，还没有定论，据“小道”消息透露它是埃塞原生种，它的树形和果簇也是类似铁皮卡那种很开阔，很清晰的结构；最大的特点是果子从绿色开始到最终成熟红色都会有一端椭圆尖尖的凸起，带着一个小圈圈像肚脐一样；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这个品种我们在两个农场的不同处理批次里都感受到了它的独特之处，相比其它品种，经过一些发酵后它很容易出一些明确的果味特征；Diviso这个批次是最近两年产品里比较“网红”的产品了，在世界赛赛场上也出现多次，在我们自己的产品册里，之前是将他作为拼配的组成之一少量使用的，但是喜欢和好奇的人儿太多，所以现在单独推出它的单品形态，都来尝尝吧～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DzjGAXaIMs5cVCkV2sghZygzZkN744DLwz8yE7v5icBVLiawE8sesG5Dg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 8px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于El Diviso\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2Dy1ogV3EicAtqVKT2jHbznuZLDXibBicYXvIGkykDHJyr8dbEcB0wqMa3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2D3NDqUbVLLeLngOsichzP8ZXCvokHYudop0JdxkBc9yribul4B8NYUrwA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n          庄园现在由3兄弟打理, 年长的Jhoan负责种植管理，Nestor负责整体运营，最年幼的Adrian负责处理以及一些市场工作；现在庄园里有种植的品种有Gesha、Java、Red bourbon、Pink bourbon、Sidra、Tabi、Colombia、Papayo、Ombligon、Chiroso和Bourbon Aji等品种，还有一些品种会有自然变异的黄色品种。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2Dia7P2zkvC3VvqnWJ5L1icUiaqlMZQ5c3ib3WJV3TnUKdT9YUbSdJE6bkUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DdTKSib6gFXDdKdLFvhfFPsuFTEpMHkqMgIN6OXG8zqiblTkSduG1WPCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          另外，Diviso还有两个战略合作的农场Zarza与Las Flores，或者说他们是一个大集团，共享所有的处理经验与同样的处理设备配置，各自打理自己的农场与采收处理，最终对外的产品销售打个字的农场名字品牌化。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于大肚脐与这个批次的处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          大肚脐这个品种是哪里来的，现在还无从得知，询问咖农得到的答案基本都说它是一个埃塞品种，因为从绿果到红果它的形状都维持独特的“肚脐”状。\n          <strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DzjGAXaIMs5cVCkV2sghZygzZkN744DLwz8yE7v5icBVLiawE8sesG5Dg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            鲜果采收后用热水浮选（热冲击），漂出浮果和杂质后，比较重的果子会在热水（50-60摄氏度）里浸泡25分钟\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            浮选热冲击浸泡后，取出鲜果，手选去除瑕疵果和一些未熟或过熟的果子\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            挑选后的果子在发酵桶中静置24小时氧化（有氧发酵），收集产生的发酵液\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            收集产生的发酵液，根据鲜果数量来加水加糖到发酵液中配出足够的发酵液，用糖液活化酿酒酵母，将其加入发酵液中混合后，加入到发酵桶中与咖啡果混合浸渍发酵72小时，期间每四小时循环使用发酵液，并监控pH值，保证其不低于3.8.\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;padding-left: 1.5em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;'>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n            发酵结束后取出咖啡果，在庄园自己定制的干燥箱（无外界热源，完全利用内置的咖啡豆/果自身热量通过循环气流来干燥）里干燥12小时，再转移到遮荫晒场干燥15天完成干燥\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于热冲击\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在哥伦期间，我了解到的热冲击有两种方式\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            高温的热冲击，80摄氏度以上，需要更为强大高效的热水器（GP92）或者类似锅炉形式（核桃树）保证大量且高温的热水，会比较短的时间，30秒到2分钟之间\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            中高温的热冲击，50-60摄氏度，类似我们家用的燃气热水器（Diviso/Flores/Zarza)，相对长的时间，20分钟左右或者更久\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          热冲击的作用（逻辑）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            杀菌：高温的热冲击，可能会有一定的杀菌作用，但由于时间短，以食品的灭菌惯例来说，以及在实际操作时大量的咖啡果的成规模的浸泡方式和容器来说，可能它的杀菌作用更多的是比较表面的清洁效果\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          改变果皮果肉果胶的细胞壁结构，这个是可能的，在一些研究文献里也有提到，高温是能够带来咖啡果的物理结构变化，而果皮果肉和果胶的这个结构变化又会给带来后续的发酵过程带来新的变量：1-如果是脱皮的，那么果皮脱除时就能更高效的“出液”（果胶的粘液，里面可都是好东西，核桃树就是这么实践并验证出来应用在产品上的）；2-不脱皮，那么后面发酵时微生菌也会更可能高效的去触及到这些”好东西“吃掉它们，代谢出来我们需要的一些”好东西“（酯类/醇类芳香物质或者前驱物质）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我的一些切身体验\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            我蒸过橘子，发现蒸出来的橘子的那个香气和甜感跟新鲜的差别很大，好像更浓郁的柑橘香气，更甜，酸度反而感受到的变弱了\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            我在Diviso时，体验了一把辣椒波旁的热冲击，放好热水（水温就是伸手进去觉得会烫，但时能伸进去短暂的停留下）我们搅拌了一会把浮选做完，然后让果子自己泡着，过了几分钟我突然闻到了一股莓果的香气，好像新鲜的树莓或者就第一反应就是好多红色莓果的感觉，也是让我很惊奇；\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            上周我去吃火锅，涮了点鲜切的西红柿下去，过了一会一拎，西红柿的皮撕拉就华丽丽的脱落了，夹了个寂寞\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这些蛛丝马迹都让我觉得，热冲击真有可能是有大用的哦！让我们接下来两个月做一些实际的尝试验证下！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IDxj9dcJ7IvlWLQ3QAPg5r3jicJ5M22Kzm6MLQqs3nuf2jnKB4hWuvYg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          热冲击（热水是有燃气热水器加热管道送上来，50-60摄氏度）\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6Is7icg9UvpYHSaUzOic09ibHAichDL4BXXRticvDxiaVMMQia3jwabDdUfDGhA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          热冲击后，手选挑除一些浮选漏掉的瑕疵果\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IUARPYnQkFoYKtiaE5OvOKJ3EmicGkZncryqv9OUmWCuRiaFopFoBdlqsQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          配置的加入酿酒酵母，水，和有氧发酵产生的发酵液的浸渍发酵\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IAyOBNY7udQia5kxBBxkwgwPUc3dkRjzBDGiaJPF3CIbuUUu5IvibNpJlg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          厌氧发酵\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TjNqBdicz3oAZsaaBeibxI6IrsuW8nueYZV5g772Fr5NxlMl2LKWVSqToNwFIjw8fyPRqttUnO77QQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          晒棚晾晒\n         </span>\n<spa